Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:39:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] Use macOS traffic-light buttons in the title bar

Move close, minimize, and maximize to the left in macOS order.
Color them red, yellow, and green, with grey when the window is
not focused. Show dark glyphs on hover.
---
 packages/config/assets/mac-maximize-2.svg |   1 +
 packages/config/assets/mac-minimize-2.svg |   1 +
 packages/config/assets/mac-minus.svg      |   1 +
 packages/config/assets/mac-x.svg          |   1 +
 packages/config/src/index.tsx             | 142 ++++++++++------------
 5 files changed, 67 insertions(+), 79 deletions(-)
